# RouterDesk core rules

- Product: local-first open-source desktop modem manager (Tauri + React + TypeScript).
- Current supported target: TP-Link VX220-G2u only.
- MVP that must keep working: modem login + connected device list.
- Language for code/docs/commits: English. Chat with the repo owner may be Turkish.
- Never commit passwords, cookies, HAR files, router backups, or personal device dumps.
- Do not add cloud backends, accounts, analytics, or PostgreSQL unless explicitly requested.
- Prefer small, reviewable changes that preserve existing drivers and UI flows.
- Before large refactors, summarize the plan and wait for approval when auth/crypto or write-operations are involved.
